# oracle: create_atoms box on a small triclinic (prism) cell, lattice custom two-atom cell, cell heights below the cutoff; per-atom positions by ID after run 0 (atom IDs follow the loop over k, j, i and basis of native's add_lattice)
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         custom 0.9 a1 1 0 0 a2 0 1 0 a3 0 0 1 basis 0 0 0 basis 0.5 0.5 0.5
region          box prism 0 2.5 0 2.2 0 2.0 0.7 0.3 0.4
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box basis 1 1 basis 2 2
mass            * 1.0
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0
thermo_style    custom step atoms pe
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             0
